   <media:title>The entire history of disabilities In Minecraft, I think </media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/cV7PSAT7rkk?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/cV7PSAT7rkk/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Minecraft is one of the top selling games of all time, and is enjoyed by hundreds of thousands of players.   Mojang and the community came together to create a set of first party and third-party mods and features, as well as devices and events to highlight and support gamers with disabilities when trying to play everyone’s favorite block game.

I have a lot of clips from a lot of people here; it would take me hours to link them all.  So, shout out to all of the creators over the past 10 years who have contributed content, both written and video, and the fare use thing.</media:description>
